5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to understand the actual impact of our past projects. I will examine the post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how we measure the actual utility of our spaces. I will review the booking data for specialist and general rooms and the timetable records on rooms out of service.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect our timelines are more optimistic than reality. I shall examine the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and the weather days in the site diaries to see where we lose time.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if the money we plan for actually matches the real costs! I'll check the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll focus on the human cost. I will examine the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines to see who is actually doing the work.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
